BANNER $79C For fixed encounters only:
BANNER $79C Write the monster count and IDs of all three groups back to the
BANNER $79C fixed monster list.
BANNER $79C 
BANNER $79C However, a bug prevents this from actually working as intended
BANNER $79C in DoA1. The fight results screen, for some reason, calls the
BANNER $79C move function twice per character, so the square it checks for
BANNER $79C the fixed encounter is 12 in the direction the party last moved.
BANNER $79C The result is that this code is never called.
BANNER $79C 
BANNER $79C A possible fix is an edited save file which places another
BANNER $79C fixed encounter (e.g. 01) twelve squares left of the Dark Lord
BANNER $79C on the map.
