BANNER $1422 This part here!
BANNER $1422 It's called within the above loop, but for som reason it
BANNER $1422 includes a call to the map move function. The combat results
BANNER $1422 page repeats the last map move 12 times, so that when the current
BANNER $1422 square is checked for fixed encounter type, it's not pointing at
BANNER $1422 a fixed encounter any more.
BANNER $1422 
BANNER $1422 DoA2 still has this code, but it moves the square type check to
BANNER $1422 elsewhere, when MapX and MapY variables are more reliable.
